  "releaseNotes": "# Release Notes\n## 1.1.0\n- Added `IPulseApiClientFactory` for creating API clients with dynamic partner credentials at runtime\n- Added `AddPulseApiClientFactory()` extension method for DI registration\n- Enables internal systems to make API requests on behalf of multiple partners without restarting or reconfiguring\n## 1.0.5\n- Updated date-related fields across request models from string to DateTimeOffset\n## 1.0.4\n- Added values array for quote request\n## 1.0.3\n- Added release notes support\n## 1.0.1\n- Bug Fixes\n## 1.0.0\n- Initial release",
